---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title={`Contact Us | 10Best Living`} description={`Get in touch with the 10Best Living team. We welcome questions, feedback, and collaboration inquiries.`} path={`/contact`}>
  <div class="bg-card">
    <div class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-gradient-to-br from-cream via-cream-dark to-cream">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-primary mb-6 leading-tight">Contact Us</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
      <div class="prose-content text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary" data-aos="fade-up">
<h2 id="sec-1">Get In Touch</h2>
<p>We'd love to hear from you. Whether you have a question about a review, a product suggestion, or a collaboration inquiry, our team is here to help.</p>

<h2 id="sec-2">Email</h2>
<p>For general inquiries and review requests: <a href="mailto:hello@10bestliving.com" class="text-gold">hello@10bestliving.com</a></p>
<p>For advertising and partnership inquiries: <a href="mailto:partnerships@10bestliving.com" class="text-gold">partnerships@10bestliving.com</a></p>

<h2 id="sec-3">Response Time</h2>
<p>We aim to respond to all inquiries within 2 business days. During peak periods, responses may take up to 48 hours.</p>

<h2 id="sec-4">Follow Us</h2>
<p>Stay connected with 10Best Living on social media for the latest reviews, deals, and product recommendations:</p>
<ul>
<li>Facebook: @10BestLiving</li>
<li>Instagram: @10bestliving</li>
<li>Twitter: @10BestLiving</li>
<li>Pinterest: @10BestLiving</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="sec-5">Office</h2>
<p>10Best Living<br>Remote-first team based in the United States<br>Established 2026</p>
</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>


